sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户 / UI
    participant Adapter as AG99 Adapter<br/>TurnCoordinator
    participant CoreQueue as AstrBot EventBus /<br/>Personal Runtime Queue
    participant Persona as Persona Runtime
    participant LLM as 主模型
    participant Curve as 可选 Performance Curve Provider
    participant TTS as TTS
    participant Buffer as PendingOutputSegment
    participant Inbound as Inbound Dispatcher
    participant Store as SessionStore
    participant Sinks as Text / Audio Sinks
    participant Orch as Playback Orchestrator
    participant Timeline as PlaybackTimelineRuntime
    participant Projection as Timeline SessionProjection
    participant Audio as HTMLAudioElement
    participant Lip as Lip-sync Sink
    participant Engine as ModelEngine
    participant Schedule as PerformanceSchedule
    participant Track as Parameter Track Graph
    participant SDK as Live2D WebSDK
    participant Completion as CompletionCoordinator
    participant ModelSync as ModelSync State

    Inbound->>Adapter: 建立 WebSocket
    Adapter-->>Inbound: system.server_info(schema_manifest)
    Inbound->>Inbound: 精确比对 protocol 与全部子 schema
    alt manifest 缺失或不一致
        Inbound--xModelSync: 拒绝后续消息，等待重载插件后重连
    else manifest 完全一致
        Adapter->>Adapter: 校验扫描缓存版本/目录摘要<br/>必要时重新扫描
        Adapter->>Adapter: 投影 live2d_scan.v3 前端能力与原始 motion locator
        Adapter-->>Inbound: system.model_sync<br/>model_info + 独立 runtime_cache_errors
        Inbound->>Inbound: 严格字段解析与 URL rewrite
        Inbound->>ModelSync: 应用模型能力和缓存诊断
    end

    User->>Adapter: input.text / input.audio
    Adapter->>Inbound: control.turn_started(turn_id)
    Inbound->>Store: 创建本轮 Session
    Adapter->>CoreQueue: commit_event(event, output_correlation_id=turn_id)
    Note over Adapter,CoreQueue: 不等待较早 Turn 播放完成，AG99 不维护输入 FIFO
    CoreQueue->>Persona: 按 AstrBot 官方队列调度
    alt 增强版 Core
        Persona->>Persona: 构建 Prompt、effect schema 与本轮上下文
        Persona->>LLM: 生成 spoken_reply + effect_calls
        LLM-->>Persona: spoken_reply + effect_calls
        Persona->>Adapter: result contributor 生成 motion_intent.v4
        Adapter->>Adapter: 登记当前回复阶段的 pending curve input
    else 官方 Core
        Persona->>Persona: on_llm_request 注入同一能力与 &lt;@anim&gt; V4 契约
        Persona->>LLM: 生成可见回复 + &lt;@anim&gt; V4
        LLM-->>Persona: 可见回复 + inline intent
        Note over Adapter,TTS: 官方无 TTSState；不启动可选曲线，不伪造 request ID
    end
    Adapter->>Adapter: 写入 ag99live_motion_schedule<br/>区分未安排、成功和动作解析失败
    Adapter->>Adapter: 输出规范化阶段清洗隐藏传输标记
    Persona->>TTS: materialize spoken_reply
    opt 增强版 Core
        TTS->>Adapter: on_tts_state_changed(generating, identities)
        opt 当前阶段存在 pending curve input
            Adapter->>Curve: 后台启动曲线请求(tts_request_id)
        end
    end
    Note over Curve,TTS: 增强版曲线与 TTS Provider 并行；TTS 与基础 motion 不等待曲线
    alt 增强版 Core
        alt TTS 成功
            TTS-->>Adapter: WAV Record + Record.text + tts_status=succeeded
        else TTS 失败
            TTS-->>Adapter: canonical text + tts_status=failed + reason
        end
    else 官方 Core
        TTS-->>Adapter: 最终 Record 或 Plain
    end
    Note over TTS,Adapter: 官方 Core 只以最终 Record 证明成功；<br/>无 Record 时无法区分未触发与失败，投影 audio absent
    Note over Adapter,Buffer: AstrBot 可以将 Plain、Record、图片和 client object 物理拆分；<br/>拆分仅存在于后端内部。Plain / semantic text / Record.text 必须归一为同一 canonical text。
    Adapter->>Buffer: 按 turn_id + message_id 合并物理组件
    Buffer->>Buffer: 校验文本冲突、多音频、motion 与 curve
    alt 曲线在段出站前 ready
        Curve-->>Buffer: 附加 performance_curve_hint
    else 曲线未启动、仍 pending 或已失败
        Buffer-->>Curve: 取消/清理请求
        Note over Buffer,Curve: pending 记录 skipped；失败保留 failed 事实；<br/>原 motion 直接出站，不生成默认曲线
    end

    loop 每个完整逻辑段
        Buffer->>Inbound: output.segment.v3<br/>唯一 text / audio URL / motion / images 完整 slots
        Inbound->>Inbound: 校验信封、slot、URL 和 motion payload
        alt 任一字段或领域校验失败
            Inbound--xStore: 拒绝整段，不写入 Store
            Note over Inbound,Store: 协议错误显式暴露，不将失败解释为 absent
        else 整段预校验通过
            Inbound->>Store: commitOutputSegment() 原子提交
            Store-->>Orch: 已解析段状态变更
            Note over Orch,Completion: 段提交后可立即起播；不等待 synth_finished
            Orch->>Timeline: 查询 open required execution timelines
            alt 仍有前一段 required sink
                Timeline-->>Orch: blocked
                Note over Orch,Timeline: 等待 Timeline execution state change；<br/>speech-only 尾段也会阻止并发
                Timeline-->>Orch: execution state changed
                Orch->>Timeline: 重新查询
                Timeline-->>Orch: releasable
            else 没有开放 required sink
                Timeline-->>Orch: releasable
            end
            Orch->>Timeline: startSegmentJob(turn_id, message_id)

            alt audio.state = present
                Timeline->>Sinks: 释放 Segment 自带音频 URL
                Sinks->>Audio: 创建并播放同一 HTMLAudioElement
                Audio->>Timeline: loadedmetadata / duration ready
                alt motion.state = present
                    Timeline->>Engine: 预编译本段语义动作
                    Engine-->>Timeline: prepared / failed
                else motion.state = absent 且模型支持说话随动
                    Timeline->>Engine: 预编译 internal speech_only request
                    Engine-->>Timeline: prepared / not_applicable / failed
                else motion.state = failed
                    Note over Timeline,Engine: 保留正式动作失败；<br/>不准备 speech-only 或默认动作
                else 无可播动作
                    Note over Timeline,Engine: 不创建动作计划，也不伪造默认动作
                end
                opt 动作准备结果 = prepared
                    Timeline->>Timeline: 注册 required motion sink
                end
                Audio->>Timeline: playing + 本 AudioElement 绑定的真实 clock
                opt text.state = present
                    Timeline->>Sinks: 释放 Segment 的唯一 canonical text 作为字幕
                    alt 字幕释放成功
                        Sinks-->>Store: text delivered
                    else 字幕 sink 不变量失败
                        Timeline->>Audio: 停止当前 HTMLAudioElement
                        Timeline->>Engine: 中断本段动作
                        Timeline->>Lip: 中断本段口型
                        Timeline->>Store: 标记 segment failed
                    end
                end
                Timeline->>Lip: 在同一 AudioElement 上启动 WebAudio RMS
                opt required motion sink 已注册且仍为 idle
                    Timeline->>Engine: 立即启动已准备计划<br/>视觉入场由 performance curve 控制
                end
            else audio.state = absent 且 motion.state = present
                opt text.state = present
                    Timeline->>Sinks: 立即释放 canonical text
                    Sinks-->>Store: text delivered
                end
                Timeline->>Timeline: 创建 synthetic motion-only clock
                Timeline->>Engine: 启动本段语义动作
            else audio.state = absent
                opt text.state = present
                    Timeline->>Sinks: 立即释放 canonical text
                    Sinks-->>Store: text delivered
                end
            else audio.state = failed
                Timeline->>Projection: 投影 audio failed
                Projection->>Store: audio.failed
                opt text.state = present
                    Timeline->>Sinks: 拒绝待显示字幕
                    Sinks->>Store: text.failed
                end
                opt motion.state = present
                    Timeline->>Projection: 投影 motion failed<br/>不转换为 audio absent
                    Projection->>Store: motion.failed
                end
            end

            opt ModelEngine 编译动作 / speech-only 动作
                Engine->>Engine: 协议 / profile / resource 校验
                Engine->>Engine: 语义阶段：九级采样 + intensity + relation graph + timing
                Engine->>Schedule: 生成共享 phrase / sequence step / 部位事件时间结构
                Schedule-->>Engine: PerformanceSchedule + 来源诊断
                Engine->>Engine: 模型参数阶段：speech channel + binding
                Engine->>Track: 将 Schedule 事件投影为 V3 keyframes / modulation
                Track-->>Engine: pose 轨道或 sequence 一次性最终轨道
                Engine->>Engine: resource policy 校验与执行仲裁
                Engine->>Engine: 输出 parameter_plan.v3
            end

            opt Audio playing 时已有准备计划
                Engine->>SDK: 立即启动准备计划<br/>视觉入场由计划曲线表达
            end

            opt 无音频但存在语义动作
                Engine->>Engine: 使用 synthetic clock 同步编译 motion-only plan
                Engine->>SDK: 启动 motion-only plan
            end

            opt 已启动语义动作 / speech-only 动作
                loop 每个渲染帧
                    SDK->>SDK: 曲线采样、动力学、冲突解析和参数写入
                end
            end

            opt audio.state = present
                Audio->>Lip: 实时 RMS / 口型值与 source 活跃状态
                Lip->>SDK: 提交 source-scoped 口型信号
                SDK->>SDK: SpeechSignalRuntime -> ActiveParameterMixer<br/>统一解析并写入口型参数
                Audio-->>Timeline: completed / failed / interrupted
                Lip-->>Timeline: completed / failed / interrupted<br/>可选 sink 终态
            end
            opt 语义动作或 speech-only 动作已启动
                SDK-->>Timeline: motion completed / failed / interrupted
            end
            Note over Timeline,Store: speech-only 共用 segment clock reader<br/>但不覆盖 motion absent 协议事实
            Timeline->>Projection: 投影稳定的 audio / 正式 motion terminal
            Projection->>Store: 回写 segment execution facts
        end
    end

    opt 官方 Core
        Persona->>Adapter: after_message_sent<br/>关闭本轮 Adapter 输出队列
    end
    Adapter->>Inbound: control.synth_finished(turn_id)<br/>所有 output.segment 发送完成后
    Inbound->>Store: assertOutputSegmentsResolved()
    alt 存在未解析段或不完整事实
        Store--xInbound: 协议一致性错误
    else 输出队列已完整关闭
        Inbound->>Store: backend.synthFinished = true
    end

    Note over Store,Completion: 口型终态归 Timeline 管理；<br/>SessionStore 段收口依据是 text / audio / motion facts
    Store-->>Completion: 协议槽位全部 settled + synthFinished
    Completion->>Timeline: 查询同 turn_id 的 open required execution
    alt speech-only 或其它 required sink 仍开放
        Timeline-->>Completion: blocked，等待 terminal
        Timeline-->>Completion: execution state changed
        Completion->>Timeline: 重新查询同 turn_id
        Timeline-->>Completion: no open required execution
    else 同 Turn execution 已收口
        Timeline-->>Completion: no open required execution
    end
    Completion->>Adapter: control.playback_finished(success, error)
    Adapter-->>Inbound: control.turn_finished
    Inbound->>Store: 标记后端轮次结束
    Store-->>User: session completed / failed

    opt WebSocket 断开
        Inbound--xAdapter: transport disconnected
        Adapter->>Adapter: 先 agent_stop_requested + stop_event
        Adapter->>Adapter: 再清理 Turn / Segment / Curve / ID map
        Note over Adapter,Persona: 被停止 event 的迟到输出在 OLVPetPlatformEvent.send 丢弃
        Inbound->>Timeline: stopAllTimelines(disconnect)
    end
